  "description": "CONVERSION OF EXISTING SINGLE STOREY REAR GARDEN BUILDING INTO SELF-CONTAINED ANCILLARY ACCOMMODATION WITH BATHROOM AND KITCHENETTE",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Merton Park",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:29:44.484Z",
  "street_name": "DORSET ROAD",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;___1ehrlty f1s184ao fpgzoln&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;___1ehrlty f1s184ao fpgzoln&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;The proposed change of use of the outbuilding from incidental to ancillary would result in a form of development that is out of keeping with the established character of the locality. The introduction of an ancillary use in this context would fail to respect the prevailing pattern of development and the role of outbuildings within the area, leading to harm to the visual amenity of the surroundings. The scheme is therefore contrary to Policies D3 and D4 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies D12.3 and D12.4 of Merton’s Local Plan (2024)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&amp;quot;MS Mincho&amp;quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:\r\nJA;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The proposed ancillary outbuilding would contain\r\none bedroom and has the potential to increase noise and disruption to nearby\r\noccupants, in particular, properties at no.151&amp;amp;155 Dorset Road and\r\n91&amp;amp;93 Daybrook Road. The proposal would therefore be contrary to, in\r\nparticular, Merton&#x27;s Local Plan 2024 policies D12.3 and D12.4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
